.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ouch-compress 1  "compress " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ouch\-compress \- Compress one or more files into one output file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBouch compress\fR [\fB\-H\fR|\fB\-\-hidden\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-gitignore\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-no\fR] [\fB\-A\fR|\fB\-\-accessible\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-level\fR] [\fB\-\-fast\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-slow\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-password\fR] [\fB\-S\fR|\fB\-\-follow\-symlinks\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILES\fR> <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Compress one or more files into one output file
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-H\fR, \fB\-\-hidden\fR
Ignore hidden files
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to yes
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-gitignore\fR
Ignore files matched by git\*(Aqs ignore files
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-no\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to no
.TP
\fB\-A\fR, \fB\-\-accessible\fR
Activate accessibility mode, reducing visual noise
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-level\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR
Compression level, applied to all formats
.TP
\fB\-\-fast\fR
Fastest compression level possible, conflicts with \-\-level and \-\-slow
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Silence output
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Specify the format of the archive
.TP
\fB\-\-slow\fR
Slowest (and best) compression level possible, conflicts with \-\-level and \-\-fast
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-password\fR \fI<PASSWORD>\fR
Decompress or list with password
.TP
\fB\-S\fR, \fB\-\-follow\-symlinks\fR
Read from target files instead of from symlinks (relevant for `tar` and `zip`)
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR
Concurrent working threads
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR
Disable the process sandbox
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILES\fR>
Files to be compressed
.TP
<\fIOUTPUT\fR>
The resulting file. Its extensions can be used to specify the compression formats
